<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulmĭnĕus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		fulmen, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			lightning</i> (<b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 382</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 11, 524</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. P. 2,
				2, 118</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ictus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 16, 11</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 14, 618</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fragor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 2, 501</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b> * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Sparkling</i>, <i>splendid</i>, <i>brilliant</i>: Mnestheus (i. e. <i>with sparkling arms</i>), <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 9,
				812</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">ib. 733</span></i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulminea in casside,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. III. Cons. Hon. 194</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			(Acc. to fulmen, II.) <i>Destructive</i>, <i>murderous</i>, <i>killing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 4, 167</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os (apri),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					2, 232</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dentes (apri),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Phaedr. 1, 21, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rictus lupi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					11, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ensis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 580</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">9, 442</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ira,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					11, 99</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">iter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Laud. Stil. 1, 200</span></i>
			.</div>
